.TH MYSTRCPY 1 "September 2026" "OS Assignment 01" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
mystrcpy \- copy one string into another

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B int mystrcpy(char *dest, const char *src);

.SH DESCRIPTION
The mystrcpy function copies the characters of the source string into the destination string and adds a terminating null character.

